    "text": "Menu item in the create (+) menu of a skill set and title of the matching quick action on its empty screen, in the AI Chat section; opens the form where a skill is written by hand. Verb, imperative or the form the language uses for menu commands, like the neighbouring Upload items; short label, no full stop. Skill = a Markdown instruction the assistant follows. Match Common:CreateSkillWithAI; the form itself is titled by Common:NewSkill.",
    "is_auto": true,
